# There is deliberately no data/private/ in this repo. Board records live
# in canyon-breeze-manor-hoa-private, a separate private repository, and
# are never checked out here. A gitignored private file inside a public
# repo is one `git add -f` away from being published, which is roughly how
# this repo leaked the first time.
data/private/
